flowchart LR
  subgraph OUTBOX[Producer delivery state]
    P[Pending] -->|bounded claim| L[Leased]
    L -->|send and conditional complete| D[Delivered]
    L -->|transient failure or lease expiry| P
    L -->|maximum attempts| DL[Dead-lettered]
    DL -->|authorized replay; preserve EventId| P
  end
  subgraph CONSUMER[Consumer decision]
    V[Validate producer, schema, tenant] -->|invalid context or payload| Q[Quarantine]
    V -->|valid| I{Inbox key exists?}
    I -->|yes| DU[Duplicate no-op]
    I -->|no| A[Commit business plus Inbox]
    I -->|business rejection| Q
  end
  L -. same immutable logical message .-> V
